<note>
<title>Code Snippet - Retry Helper</title>
<content><![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>Small retry helper used in the ingestion pipeline:</div>
<div><br/></div>
<div style="font-family: monospace; white-space: pre;">def retry(fn, attempts=3, delay=1.0):
    for i in range(attempts):
        try:
            return fn()
        except Exception as e:
            if i == attempts - 1:
                raise
            time.sleep(delay)
</div>
<div><br/></div>
<div>Retry budget by environment:</div>
<table style="border-collapse:collapse;">
<tr>
<th style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;">Environment</th>
<th style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;">Max Attempts</th>
<th style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;">Delay (s)</th>
</tr>
<tr><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;">dev</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;">2</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;">0.5</td></tr>
<tr><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;">staging</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;">3</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;">1.0</td></tr>
<tr><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;">prod</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;">5</td><td style="border:1px solid #999;padding:4px;">2.0</td></tr>
</table></en-note>]]></content>
<created>20260410T140000Z</created>
<updated>20260410T140900Z</updated>
<tag>engineering</tag><tag>code</tag><tag>snippet</tag>
